{"id":"n27826-1-10","stage":2,"title":"출국 · 出国","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n27826-1-10-1","ko":"이모가 다음 달에 이민을 간다는구나.","zh":"原来姨妈下个月要移民啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이모가","meaning":"阿姨，姨妈","explanation":"이모：阿姨，姨妈；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"이모","audio":"/audio/dfd6511ae5195e09a7c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71153","senseId":"1","lemma":"이모","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다음","meaning":"下面，下一个","explanation":"다음：下面，下一个","readings":[{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64531","senseId":"2","lemma":"다음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"달에","meaning":"月","explanation":"달：月；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"달","audio":"/audio/2f941e6eb2150679c43f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62266","senseId":"2","lemma":"달","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이민을","meaning":"移民","explanation":"이민：移民；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"이민","audio":"/audio/7ebe080ba405c2579583.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24884","senseId":"1","lemma":"이민","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"간다는구나.","meaning":"去；表示引用。","explanation":"가다：去；하다：表示引用。；ㄴ다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。；는구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"},{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"dfd6511ae5195e09","term":"이모","zh":"阿姨，姨妈","audio":"/audio/dfd6511ae5195e09a7c7.mp3","entryId":"71153","definition":"用于指称或称呼母亲的姐姐或妹妹。","pronunciation":["이모"]},{"id":"aef613c6612d424a","term":"다음","zh":"下面，下一个","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3","entryId":"64531","definition":"这个次序的后一个。","pronunciation":["다음"]},{"id":"2f941e6eb2150679","term":"달","zh":"月","audio":"/audio/2f941e6eb2150679c43f.mp3","entryId":"62266","definition":"把一年分为十二个的每个时间段。","pronunciation":["달"]},{"id":"7ebe080ba405c257","term":"이민","zh":"移民","audio":"/audio/7ebe080ba405c2579583.mp3","entryId":"24884","definition":"离开祖国而到外国生活。","pronunciation":["이민"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示引用。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示引用。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/18abd177744d5401e50f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n27826-1-10-2","ko":"정말요? 출국 날짜는 언제예요?","zh":"真的吗？出发日期是什么时候？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"정말요?","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的；요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"출국","meaning":"出国，出境","explanation":"출국：出国，出境","readings":[{"term":"출국","audio":"/audio/0ff04342cee899e92951.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27826","senseId":"1","lemma":"출국","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"날짜는","meaning":"日，日期","explanation":"날짜：日，日期；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"날짜","audio":"/audio/09f76a1b7a6712eeafef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58157","senseId":"3","lemma":"날짜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"언제예요?","meaning":"什么时候","explanation":"언제：什么时候；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17860","senseId":"1","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"0ff04342cee899e9","term":"출국","zh":"出国，出境","audio":"/audio/0ff04342cee899e92951.mp3","entryId":"27826","definition":"跨越国境，去别的国家。","pronunciation":["출국"]},{"id":"09f76a1b7a6712ee","term":"날짜","zh":"日，日期","audio":"/audio/09f76a1b7a6712eeafef.mp3","entryId":"58157","definition":"某年的某月某日。","pronunciation":["날짜"]},{"id":"25f9ca42793d0a69","term":"언제","zh":"什么时候","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3","entryId":"17860","definition":"不知道的某时。","pronunciation":["언ː제"]}],"audio":"/audio/d08f296c69df1533bd1b.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.94,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=27826","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":68,"sequenceScore":1.7667,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["真的吗？出发日期是什么时候？","原来姨妈下个月要移民啊。","你怎么这么会做饭？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["原来姨妈下个月要移民啊。","你怎么这么会做饭？","真的吗？出发日期是什么时候？"],"answer":2}]}
